请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-02-earphone-music-007

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
弄个耳机卡，主体是图，显示一行带数字的话，点一下能跳app

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "弄个耳机卡，主体是图，显示一行带数字的话，点一下能跳app",
  "size": "2x4",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToDeeplink",
      "args": {
        "bundleName": "",
        "abilityName": "",
        "uri": "hwmusic://com.huawei.hmsapp.music/showMusicList?code=a001&type=4"
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "music": {
      "listeningLine": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "耳机音乐卡片中显示的一行带数字的听歌提示文案。",
        "sampleValue": "今日已听 30 首"
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_earphone.png",
      "description": "耳机图标素材，适合用作耳机音乐卡片的主体视觉。"
    },
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_music.png",
      "description": "音乐图标素材，适合用作音乐入口或播放场景的辅助识别。"
    }
  ]
}

